    "justification": "Shared_RandomForest achieves strong temporal test RMSE (0.3547 t/ha, R2=0.5519) substantially outperforming the GlobalMeanBaseline (0.5369 t/ha, R2=-0.027) and HistoricalCropDistrictBaseline (0.4136 t/ha, R2=0.3908). On spatial leave-one-district-out evaluation, Shared_RandomForest achieves RMSE 0.3807 t/ha (R2=0.6121). Dedicated crop-specific models perform comparably on high-sample crops (e.g. Maize, Soybean) but suffer higher variance on smaller-sample crops, validating the shared representation."
